  "title": "Voodoo Pasta",
  "description": "Voodoo pasta is ready as quickly as the fusilli cooks. Make a spicy Alfredo sauce with blackened smoked sausage, and when the pasta is done, just toss everything together. It's pure magic.",
  "authors": [
    "Hillshire FarmR Brand"
